id=tor-relay
name=Tor Bridge (VPN-aware)
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=kaandikec
description=Tor 0.4.9.8 bridge node (NOT exit) for ZTE F50. Contributes anonymous bandwidth to the Tor network from your cellular SIM. VPN-aware routing — when Tailscale is up, Tor outbound traffic exits via the tailnet (so the bridge presence isn't tied to your operator IP); when Tailscale is down, falls back to cellular. Includes bundled libssl.so.3 + libcrypto.so.3 (~8MB). Bridge bandwidth capped at 256 KB/s by default. Requires bin-utils v1.3.0+.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dikeckaan/magisk-zte-f50-tor-relay/main/update.json
